======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 83 - Circuit Breakers
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Service A blocks for 30s waiting on unresponsive Service B until thread pool dies.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Circuit breaker tripping to OPEN after 5 consecutive failures, fast-failing for 30s.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
